"""Editorial profiles: verified service statements are distinct from owner exercises."""
# key, name, primary source, brief verified scope, decision, evidence request, hypothetical scenario
DATA=[
('awning','Awning Design','https://website.awning.com/vacation-rental-furnishing','Awning publishes vacation-rental furnishing, design and setup services, with electronics and household amenities included in the described scope.','Separate furnishing from ongoing management.','Ask whether the furnishing agreement can stand alone and obtain a room inventory, assembly scope and electronics commissioning checklist.','A remote owner has a furnished living room but empty bedrooms. A whole-home package may include unnecessary replacements. Mark the retained sofa and dining table on the plan, then request separate prices for missing furniture, electronics setup and final stocking.'),
('parklin','Parklin Interiors','https://parklininteriors.com/about-us','Parklin describes design boards, layouts, product links and installation guidance, with project-management support listed separately.','Distinguish design documentation from the execution assignment.','Request the selected service tier, purchasing responsibilities, receiving arrangement and installer supervision in writing.','A cabin owner can supervise local trades but wants a cohesive indoor and outdoor concept. Review the deck and living-room plans together, then decide whether ordering and receiving should remain with the owner or enter a separate project-management scope.'),
('str-design-lab','STR Design Lab','https://www.strdesignlab.com/airbnbdesign','STR Design Lab describes conceptual, full-plan and renovation/furnishing design tiers, with boards, ordering assistance and 3D guidance.','Match the design tier to the work contractors actually need.','Request a sample deliverable and ask whether field measurements, purchasing, site labor and revision rounds are included.','A renovation owner needs cabinet and lighting decisions before furniture can be ordered. Ask the team to separate construction decisions from furnishing selections, and make contractor approval of dimensions a prerequisite for purchasing.'),
('surge','Surge','https://www.gowithsurge.com/','Surge describes property management, investment brokerage and interior design, including furnishing, procurement, installation and photography coordination.','Evaluate the design engagement separately from the operating relationship.','Request address eligibility and separate design, brokerage and management scopes. Confirm who owns the furniture and project records.','An investor has already purchased a property and selected a manager. Compare a furnishing-only proposal with a combined service offer, removing acquisition and management work that the investor does not need.'),
('bee-setups','Bee Setups','https://www.beesetups.com/packages','Bee Setups lists several package tiers with different revision allowances and describes sourcing, delivery, assembly and staging. Furniture cost is separate from the displayed package fees.','Compare the chosen package against the complete guest-ready inventory.','Ask which indoor and outdoor rooms, kitchen essentials, linens and installation tasks are covered by the quoted tier.','A studio owner sees a low entry design fee. Build a second column for furniture, taxes, receiving and household supplies before comparing the total with a larger bundled proposal.'),
('showplace','Showplace','https://www.showplacehq.com/','Showplace presents rental design and furnishing, digital room visualization and property-planning services.','Turn the visualization into a measurable installation plan.','Request a dimensioned layout, item specification list, delivery responsibility and the specific on-site setup option for the address.','An owner likes a rendering of an eight-person dining room. Test the actual table size, pulled-out chair space and route to the patio before approving purchases; the attractive view alone cannot establish circulation.'),
('somerled-designs','Somerled Designs','https://www.somerleddesigns.com/work-with-us','Somerled distinguishes virtual design from additional project management that includes procurement, delivery coordination, installation and photo staging.','Price the handoff model before choosing an attractive fee.','Request the exact virtual deliverables and a separate project-management scope, with the signed handoff date and address coverage.','An out-of-state owner has no receiving team. A virtual plan could still fit, but only if the owner hires and budgets for a local execution lead. Compare that complete arrangement with managed implementation.'),
('strcribs','STR Cribs','https://www.strcribs.com/','STR Cribs presents rental design and renovation across interiors, outdoor areas and amenities.','Separate construction readiness from furnishing readiness.','Request trade scopes, permit responsibility, allowance items, procurement dates and an independently checkable punch list.','A backyard amenity project overlaps a bathroom renovation. Furniture delivery should follow the agreed dust-producing work and secure storage plan, rather than an optimistic date based only on ordering lead time.'),
('vacay-rental-design','Vacay Rental Design','https://vacayrentaldesign.com/packages','Vacay Rental Design publishes rental-design packages, including a full-service design and installation option.','Choose the package by retained furniture and execution needs.','Ask which rooms, furnishing purchases, delivery and installation are included and how the proposal handles retained items.','A beach rental needs durable dining seating and bedroom updates but already has serviceable casegoods. Photograph and measure retained pieces before requesting a package so the proposal does not assume a completely empty home.'),
('fulhaus','Fülhaus','https://fulhaus.com/','The current Fülhaus homepage emphasizes Ludwig, an AI design service with shoppable furniture selections and vendor-direct logistics.','Verify the current offering instead of relying on older package descriptions.','Request current human-design support, measurement review, vendor ordering terms, receiving and installation responsibilities.','An owner has an old furniture-package quote and a new AI-generated room concept. Reconcile the actual product identifiers, dimensions and delivery terms before treating the two offers as equivalent services.'),
('furnishr','Furnishr','https://furnishr.com/faq/','Furnishr describes design, furniture sourcing, shipping coordination and on-site assembly. Its FAQ distinguishes these from structural changes, wall mounting and unpacking household kits.','Budget for the work that remains after furniture assembly.','Request the current exclusions and assign wall mounting, painting, household-kit staging and guest-readiness testing to named people.','A property receives beds and seating on setup day, but the televisions and mirrors still need mounting and the dishes need washing and placement. Reserve a separate completion window before photography and guest arrival.'),
('laurie-mattson-interiors','Laurie Mattson Interiors','https://www.lauriemattsoninteriors.com/short-term-rental-design/full-service-interior-design','The reviewed full-service STR page describes a virtual process with room planning, design boards, shopping information and installation guidance.','Clarify what full service means for an owner outside the studio’s local area.','Request written confirmation of who measures, orders, receives, assembles and checks the finished rooms at the property.','An overseas owner wants a complete design plan for a U.S. condo. The virtual design may provide useful direction, but the local property contact must verify dimensions and manage delivery access and the final inspection.'),
('bnb-turnkey','BNB Turnkey','https://bnb-turnkey.com/services','BNB Turnkey describes acquisition assistance, design and preparation, and property management within an investor-service model.','Compare the separate parts of the investment engagement.','Ask which entity contracts for acquisition, construction, furniture and management, and which fees continue after launch.','An owner already has an operating rental and only needs a refresh. Start with a furnishing and design scope; evaluate broader acquisition or management support only if it addresses an actual gap.'),
('coveted-haus','Coveted Haus','https://covetedhaus.com/about-coveted-haus','Coveted Haus describes full-service and eDesign work across residential, short-term-rental and commercial projects.','Select the service mode rather than assuming the firm is virtual-only.','Request a proposal for the relevant full-service or eDesign option, with deliverables, site visits and purchasing support.','An Austin owner wants to retain a dining table and commission a new living-room plan. Compare an eDesign handoff with a full-service refresh by listing the owner’s available time and local installation support.'),
('winland-designs','Winland Designs','https://www.winlanddesigns.com/','Winland describes consultation and full-service interior design, including project management, furniture selection, receiving and installation.','Check rental-operating requirements within a broader interior-design scope.','Request a relevant rental example and specifications for cleanability, replacement availability, room capacity and turnover.','A residential-style proposal uses delicate accent pieces in a group rental. Ask for an operating review of each high-touch surface and a replacement route for pieces that will be handled on every turnover.'),
('designaholic','Designaholic',None,'The legacy page did not establish a verified official source for the specific STR service it described. Current package, coverage, price and performance claims remain unverified.','Confirm the business identity before evaluating a virtual design offer.','Request the legal business name, official domain, sample contract and a dated deliverable example. Do not infer service details from a similar name.','An owner receives a mood-board offer through social media. Before paying, match the invoice entity to the contract and official contact channel, then request a complete room sample with product dimensions and implementation notes.'),
('str-design-solutions','STR Design Solutions',None,'The legacy page used a broad service name without enough official evidence to identify and verify one provider. No current provider rating or package claim is established here.','Disambiguate the provider from the general phrase STR design solutions.','Obtain the official domain, business identity and a property-specific written scope before comparing it with any named studio.','Two proposals use similar design-solution branding. Label each by legal entity and contact domain, then compare only the signed deliverables instead of combining testimonials or package details from different businesses.')]
PROFILES={r[0]:dict(zip(['key','name','source','scope','decision','request','scenario'],r)) for r in DATA}
